  "body": "Experience an exceptional standard of living at 25C Lomond Street, Takapuna-a sophisticated residence where architectural excellence, premium craftsmanship, and an unbeatable location come together in perfect harmony.\r\n\r\nDesigned by acclaimed architect Alan Shanahan, this high-spec home showcases timeless contemporary design with every detail carefully considered. Expansive floor-to-ceiling glazing and strategically positioned skylights bathe the interiors in natural light, while refined finishes, generous proportions, and a private internal lift deliver effortless luxury across all three levels.\r\n\r\nFeatures You'll Love:\r\n\r\n* Solid, low-maintenance construction built for modern living\r\n* Designer open-plan kitchen featuring a premium Dekton stone benchtop, Gaggenau appliances, and fully integrated German refrigerator, freezer, and dishwasher\r\n* Spacious open-plan living and dining flowing seamlessly to private outdoor entertaining areas\r\n* Central air-conditioning providing year-round comfort throughout the home\r\n* Private internal lift servicing all three levels for ultimate convenience\r\n* Internal-access double garage with a private lift serving all three levels\r\n\r\nPositioned in one of Takapuna's most sought-after streets, you're just a short stroll from Takapuna Beach, Shore City Shopping Centre, boutique cafés, award-winning restaurants, and the vibrant coastal lifestyle that makes this neighbourhood so highly regarded. Commuting is effortless with easy motorway access to Auckland CBD.\r\n\r\nFamilies will appreciate the excellent school zoning, including Takapuna Primary School, Takapuna Normal Intermediate, Westlake Girls High School, and Takapuna Grammar School-making this an outstanding choice for both lifestyle and long-term value.\r\n\r\nLuxury homes of this calibre in such a tightly held location are seldom available. Secure your place in one of Auckland's most desirable coastal communities.\r\n\r\nContact Team Hattie today to arrange your private viewing or visit one of our scheduled open homes.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nhttps://harcourts.net/L41467604",
